+// Studix: page scripts must not reach any network from the capture browser. Routable destinations go to
+// a proxy that does not exist and fail without a DIRECT fallback. Chrome skips proxies for loopback and
+// link-local (169.254.0.0/16, fe80::/10) targets; those are stopped by the resolver rules, which fail every
